# In-app notifications

Any event that changes a customer's **turn** must push an **in-app** notification: delay, chair disable, reorder, people-ahead change, expected wait change.

```php
// ❌ BAD
WhatsApp::send($customer->phone, $body);
Sms::send($customer->phone, $body);

// ✅ GOOD
CustomerPush::queueTurnChanged($visit, $change);
```

Do not add WhatsApp, SMS, or email as the channel for turn updates. The ticket (number, people ahead, expected wait) lives in the app.
